%[text] %[text:anchor:H_EC5E9984] ## Background
%[text] Model variables
%[text] - $\\theta$: the rotary arm angle, measured relative to the marker \[degrees\]
%[text] - $\\alpha$: the pendulum angle, measured relative to the upright position \[degrees\] \
%[text] Model parameters
%[text] - $L\_a$: the length of the rotary arm
%[text] - $L\_p$: the length of the pendulum \
